# Copy this file to .env. The file .env is ignored by git and never committed.
# make dev, make test-smoke, the gate targets, and docker compose read it.
# Leave a secret empty here. Put the real value in .env only.
# Verified against the code on 2026-08-28 (docs/audit-2026-08-28.md, P-17).

# --- Provider keys (PR-10, D-41). Required unless LLM_REQUIRE_KEYS=0. ---
OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# LLM_REQUIRE_KEYS=0 lets the fixture fake stand in. make dev sets it. The fake
# serves the health role only (D-267), so a chat turn fails with a clear message.
# LLM_REQUIRE_KEYS=1

# --- Per-role overrides: LLM_<ROLE>_PROVIDER, LLM_<ROLE>_MODEL, LLM_<ROLE>_EFFORT.
# Roles: classify, ask, generate, repair, judge, eval, revise.
# Defaults: go/internal/llm/roles.json. make eval-calibrate sets the eval pair.
# LLM_GENERATE_MODEL=gpt-5.6-sol
# LLM_EVAL_PROVIDER=anthropic
# LLM_EVAL_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# --- API process (go/cmd/api) ---
# PORT=8080
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS is a comma-separated list of browser origins for CORS.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5180
# ALLOW_DEBUG_USER=1 accepts a request with no Firebase token and uses DEBUG_USER_ID
# (default local-dev). Local only (D-268). make dev sets it.
# ALLOW_DEBUG_USER=1
# DEBUG_USER_ID=local-dev
# CARDS_RELOAD_SECONDS is how often the API looks for a new snapshot. Default 600.
# make dev sets 15 for fast seeding.
# CARDS_RELOAD_SECONDS=600

# --- The web app (web/apps/web). Vite reads these at build time. ---
# VITE_API_BASE_URL is the API origin the browser calls. make dev sets it.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8090
# VITE_AUTH_EMULATOR_HOST is the Firebase Auth emulator the sign-in uses locally.
# VITE_AUTH_EMULATOR_HOST=127.0.0.1:9199

# --- GCP and the local emulators (D-9). make dev sets the emulator hosts. ---
# PROJECT_ID=mtg-local
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=mtg-local
# FIRESTORE_EMULATOR_HOST=127.0.0.1:8281
# FIREBASE_AUTH_EMULATOR_HOST=127.0.0.1:9199
# STORAGE_EMULATOR_HOST=http://127.0.0.1:4443
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS is the service-account file for a real project.
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=
# K_SERVICE is set by Cloud Run. Never set it by hand.

# --- Card snapshot ---
# CARDS_SNAPSHOT_DIR reads a snapshot from disk instead of the bucket. The gate
# targets set it to .local/gcs/mtg-local-cards/scryfall.
# CARDS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=
# CARDS_BUCKET=mtg-local-cards
# SCRYFALL_BASE_URL points the worker at another Scryfall host, for tests.
# SCRYFALL_BASE_URL=https://api.scryfall.com

# --- The tuning loop (docs/reference/autotune-readme.md) ---
# AUTOTUNE_FIXER_CMD names the fixer agent. Keep the quotation marks (D-159).
# AUTOTUNE_FIXER_CMD="claude -p --permission-mode bypassPermissions"
# AUTOTUNE_ALLOW_UNATTENDED=1 lets scripts/autotune.sh start. Set it on the
# command line, not here.

# --- Spend guards. Each command refuses to run without its variable. The Make
# targets set them. Never set one here: that would make every run spend money.
# QUESTIONS_GATE=1   make questions-gate
# QUESTIONS_EVAL=1   make questions-eval
# DECK_GATE=1        make deck-gate
# CHAT_PROBE=1       make chat-probe
# GENERATE_PROBE=1   make generate-probe
# SUMMARY_JUDGE=1    make summary-judge
# REVISE_GATE=1      make revise-gate
# FAKE_GCS_LIVE=1    the live fake-gcs tests, set by CI (verify:emulator)
